Description: deterministic release toolkit for Valkyrian Labs projects
 vl-release (also available as vlr) manages the release contract of a Git
 repository: version consistency across files, agent-maintained staged
 release documentation and its deterministic promotion into the published
 history, Debian package builds and contract validation, reproducible source
 archives, integrity-checked APT publication and verification, GitHub
 releases, and Homebrew tap formulas.
